; Ledgeline projection
; projection: Parity flows
; created: 2026-10-20
; updated: 2026-10-20
; cash: assets:checking

; Flows with EXPLICIT counter-accounts (plan 28 Decision 1): every rule is
; ordinary balanced hledger, so `hledger bs|is|cf --forecast` over the main
; journal plus this file must agree with Ledgeline per account, per period.
; Interval-less recurrences (weekly, every 2 weeks, quarterly, yearly) with no
; start pin where each tool puts the first occurrence; a bounded rule pins
; `from` (inclusive) and `to` (exclusive); a dated rule fires once.

~ monthly  salary and rent
    revenues:salary      $-6000.00
    expenses:rent         $2000.00
    assets:checking

~ monthly  card spending
    expenses:food          $600.00
    liabilities:card

~ monthly  card payment
    liabilities:card       $600.00
    assets:checking

~ quarterly  insurance
    expenses:insurance     $900.00
    assets:savings

~ weekly  coffee
    expenses:food           $25.00
    assets:checking

~ every 2 weeks  allowance
    expenses:food           $40.00
    assets:checking

~ yearly  subscription
    expenses:insurance     $120.00
    assets:checking

~ monthly from 2026-11-15 to 2027-03-15  consulting, bounded
    expenses:consulting   $1000.00
    assets:checking

~ 2026-12-20  year-end bonus
    revenues:bonus       $-5000.00
    assets:checking
